# Reach the other agent VMs over Tailscale by short name. Bare names can
# misresolve when a VM's DHCP hands out its own search domains, so we pin each
# to its full MagicDNS name via HostName. The tailnet's MagicDNS suffix is
# tailnet-specific, so it isn't committed to this public repo: it lives in
# ~/.ssh/tailnet (generated locally per VM, see README). A missing Include is
# harmless, so this file still works before that's set up.
Include tailnet

Host sandbox-amd64
  User agent-amd64

Host sandbox-arm64
  User agent-arm64

Host tahoe-vanilla
  User admin
